<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Privacy Policy — Disk Partition Calculator</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --primary: #1a6b4e;
      --primary-light: #e8f5ef;
      --surface: #f8faf9;
      --surface-border: #dce5e0;
      --on-surface: #1a1c1b;
      --on-surface-muted: #4a4e4c;
      --shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    }

    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #f0f4f2;
      color: var(--on-surface);
      line-height: 1.6;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 720px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 32px 20px 64px;
    }

    /* Header Card */
    .header-card {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 16px;
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--surface-border);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 20px;
      box-shadow: 0 5px 18px var(--shadow);
    }

    .header-icon {
      width: 50px;
      height: 50px;
      background: var(--primary-light);
      border-radius: 12px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .header-icon svg {
      width: 26px;
      height: 26px;
      fill: none;
      stroke: var(--primary);
      stroke-width: 2;
      stroke-linecap: round;
      stroke-linejoin: round;
    }

    .header-title {
      font-size: 22px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--on-surface);
    }

    .header-subtitle {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--on-surface-muted);
      margin-top: 2px;
    }

    /* Effective Date */
    .effective-date {
      display: inline-block;
      background: var(--surface);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 8px 14px;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--on-surface-muted);
      margin-top: 24px;
    }

    /* Section */
    .section {
      margin-top: 24px;
    }

    .section-header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .section-icon {
      width: 36px;
      height: 36px;
      background: var(--primary-light);
      border-radius: 10px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .section-icon svg {
      width: 20px;
      height: 20px;
      fill: none;
      stroke: var(--primary);
      stroke-width: 2;
      stroke-linecap: round;
      stroke-linejoin: round;
    }

    .section-title {
      font-size: 17px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--on-surface);
    }

    .section-content {
      font-size: 14.5px;
      color: var(--on-surface-muted);
      line-height: 1.65;
      padding-left: 48px;
    }

    /* Bullet List */
    .bullet-list {
      list-style: none;
      padding: 0;
      margin: 10px 0;
    }

    .bullet-list li {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 10px;
      font-size: 14.5px;
      color: var(--on-surface-muted);
      line-height: 1.65;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .bullet-list li::before {
      content: '';
      width: 6px;
      height: 6px;
      background: var(--primary);
      border-radius: 50%;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      margin-top: 8px;
    }

    .section-footer {
      font-size: 14.5px;
      color: var(--on-surface-muted);
      line-height: 1.65;
      margin-top: 10px;
    }

    /* Consent Banner */
    .consent-banner {
      margin-top: 28px;
      background: var(--primary-light);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 16px 20px;
      font-size: 14.5px;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: var(--on-surface);
    }

    /* Contact Card */
    .contact-card {
      margin-top: 28px;
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--surface-border);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 20px;
    }

    .contact-row {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      margin-top: 16px;
      font-size: 14.5px;
    }

    .contact-row:first-of-type { margin-top: 16px; }

    .contact-label {
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--on-surface-muted);
    }

    .contact-link {
      color: var(--primary);
      font-weight: 500;
      text-decoration: underline;
      text-underline-offset: 2px;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .contact-link:hover {
      opacity: 0.8;
    }

    /* Responsive */
    @media (max-width: 480px) {
      .container { padding: 20px 16px 48px; }
      .header-card { padding: 16px; }
      .section-content { padding-left: 0; }
      .bullet-list li { padding-left: 0; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">

    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="header-card">
      <div class="header-icon">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="header-title">Privacy Policy</div>
        <div class="header-subtitle">Disk Partition Calculator</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Effective Date -->
    <div class="effective-date">Effective Date: August 20, 2026</div>

    <!-- Introduction -->
    <div class="section">
      <div class="section-header">
        <div class="section-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="12" y1="16" x2="12" y2="12"/><line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12.01" y2="8"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="section-title">Introduction</div>
      </div>
      <div class="section-content">
        Disk Partition Calculator ("we", "our", or "us") is committed to protecting your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and safeguard your information when you use our mobile application. By using Disk Partition Calculator, you agree to the collection and use of information in accordance with this policy.
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Information We Collect -->
    <div class="section">
      <div class="section-header">
        <div class="section-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M22 19a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h5l2 3h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="section-title">Information We Collect</div>
      </div>
      <div class="section-content">
        We believe in minimal data collection. Disk Partition Calculator collects the following:
        <ul class="bullet-list">
          <li>Conversion History — Your past calculations are stored locally on your device for your convenience.</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="section-footer">
          We do NOT collect, store, or transmit any personal identifiable information such as your name, email address, phone number, location, or device identifiers.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- How We Use Your Information -->
    <div class="section">
      <div class="section-header">
        <div class="section-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/><path d="M19.4 15a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 .33 1.82l.06.06a2 2 0 0 1-2.83 2.83l-.06-.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.82-.33 1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1 1.51V21a2 2 0 0 1-4 0v-.09A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 9 19.4a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.82.33l-.06.06a2 2 0 0 1-2.83-2.83l.06-.06A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 4.68 15a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.51-1H3a2 2 0 0 1 0-4h.09A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 4.6 9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-.33-1.82l-.06-.06a2 2 0 0 1 2.83-2.83l.06.06A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 9 4.68a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1-1.51V3a2 2 0 0 1 4 0v.09a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1 1.51 1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.82-.33l.06-.06a2 2 0 0 1 2.83 2.83l-.06.06A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 19.4 9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.51 1H21a2 2 0 0 1 0 4h-.09a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.51 1z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="section-title">How We Use Your Information</div>
      </div>
      <div class="section-content">
        The limited data we store is used solely to:
        <ul class="bullet-list">
          <li>Provide accurate disk partition size calculations</li>
          <li>Maintain your local calculation history</li>
          <li>Improve app functionality and user experience</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Data Storage & Security -->
    <div class="section">
      <div class="section-header">
        <div class="section-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="section-title">Data Storage &amp; Security</div>
      </div>
      <div class="section-content">
        Your calculation history is stored exclusively on your device using Android's local SharedPreferences storage. This data is never uploaded to any server, cloud service, or external database. There are no remote databases, cloud syncs, or API calls that transmit your data. Your device is the only place your calculation history exists.
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Third-Party Services -->
    <div class="section">
      <div class="section-header">
        <div class="section-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="2" y1="12" x2="22" y2="12"/><path d="M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="section-title">Third-Party Services</div>
      </div>
      <div class="section-content">
        Disk Partition Calculator does not use any third-party services. Specifically, we do not integrate or transmit data to:
        <ul class="bullet-list">
          <li>Analytics services (no Google Analytics, Firebase Analytics, or similar)</li>
          <li>Advertising or ad networks (no AdMob, Facebook Ads, or similar)</li>
          <li>Crash reporting tools (no Crashlytics, Sentry, or similar)</li>
          <li>Tracking or fingerprinting SDKs</li>
          <li>Social media SDKs</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="section-footer">
          The only network communication is for Google Play In-App Updates, which checks for app version availability and does not involve your personal data.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Data Deletion & User Choices -->
    <div class="section">
      <div class="section-header">
        <div class="section-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="section-title">Data Deletion &amp; User Choices</div>
      </div>
      <div class="section-content">
        You have full control over your data at all times:
        <ul class="bullet-list">
          <li>Access — Browse all saved calculations via the History panel at any time.</li>
          <li>Delete Individual — Remove specific calculation entries from your history.</li>
          <li>Delete All — Use the Clear All option in the History panel to erase all stored data at once.</li>
          <li>Complete Removal — Uninstall the app to permanently delete all locally stored data from your device.</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="section-footer">
          Since all data is stored locally on your device and never transmitted externally, no server-side deletion request is required. Removing the app removes everything.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Children's Privacy -->
    <div class="section">
      <div class="section-header">
        <div class="section-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M8 14s1.5 2 4 2 4-2 4-2"/><line x1="9" y1="9" x2="9.01" y2="9"/><line x1="15" y1="9" x2="15.01" y2="9"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="section-title">Children's Privacy</div>
      </div>
      <div class="section-content">
        Disk Partition Calculator is not directed at children. We do not knowingly collect personal data from anyone, including minors. The age of digital consent varies by jurisdiction — for example, 13 years in the United States (COPPA), 16 years in the European Economic Area under GDPR, and other ages in different countries. Since this app collects no personal information whatsoever, it is safe for users of all ages.
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Changes to This Policy -->
    <div class="section">
      <div class="section-header">
        <div class="section-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polyline points="23 4 23 10 17 10"/><path d="M20.49 15a9 9 0 1 1-2.12-9.36L23 10"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="section-title">Changes to This Policy</div>
      </div>
      <div class="section-content">
        We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be reflected in this page and the "Last Updated" date will be revised. We encourage you to review this policy periodically.
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Compliance -->
    <div class="section">
      <div class="section-header">
        <div class="section-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="section-title">Compliance</div>
      </div>
      <div class="section-content">
        This Privacy Policy is designed to comply with applicable privacy laws and regulations, including the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) and the California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA). As we do not collect personal data, most regulatory obligations are inherently satisfied.
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Consent Banner -->
    <div class="consent-banner">
      By using Disk Partition Calculator, you consent to this Privacy Policy.
    </div>

    <!-- Contact Us -->
    <div class="contact-card">
      <div class="section-header" style="margin-bottom: 0;">
        <div class="section-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z"/><polyline points="22,6 12,13 2,6"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="section-title">Contact Us</div>
      </div>
      <div class="contact-row">
        <span class="contact-label">App:</span>
        <a class="contact-link" href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.diskcalc" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Disk Partition Calculator</a>
      </div>
      <div class="contact-row">
        <span class="contact-label">Developer:</span>
        <a class="contact-link" href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/dev?id=5574132061091657048" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Sajedur0</a>
      </div>
      <div class="contact-row">
        <span class="contact-label">Email:</span>
        <a class="contact-link" href="mailto:Sajedurzero@gmail.com">Sajedurzero@gmail.com</a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</body>
</html>
